<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Fourth round</p>
<p>8-Boris Becker (Germany) beat 9-Marcelo Rios (Chile)  6-2  6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat 12-Patrick Rafter (Australia)</p>
<p>6-7 (2-7) 6-4 7-6 (8-6) 6-3</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat 3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)</p>
<p>6-2 7-5 2-6 6-1</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>To finish:</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) leads 4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 6-7 7-6</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) leads 16-Petr Korda (Czech Republic)  6-4</p>
<p>4-2</p>
</text>
